title: "climbtrack: climbing session tracking from a wrist IMU"
abstract: "Climb/rest segmentation (sticky Gaussian HMM), time-on-wall and movement-smoothness metrics (LDLJ-A, SPARC) from wrist accelerometry. Validated on synthetic data only."
